Kev — jaredpalmer/kev, Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/jaredpalmer/kev
  Kev-0.6B is a LoRA adapter plus a pointer head over Qwen3-0.6B-Base. This
  project merges that adapter into a conv-form trunk and runs it on the Apple
  Neural Engine. The record encoding and block-causal branch mask in
  src/kev_ane/encode.py are reimplemented against Kev's published contract and
  are checked against Kev's own implementation by gates/g0_encode_parity.py.

Qwen3-0.6B-Base — Alibaba Cloud / Qwen, Apache License 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B-Base
  Base weights. Downloaded, never vendored.

